<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.scratch.opens ~ a scratch sensorium stands live until dissolved

`lares sensorium open <path> [--name <n>]` spins up a scratch sensorium, ingests the path, leaves it live and prints its id.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ open

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`open` params=`path/notes ~ open a live sensorium over a path`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ path · name

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`path` params=`takes/host-path needs/required seat/1 as/<path> ~ the path to ingest`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`name` params=`takes/name ~ a label for the sensorium`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ works this host's scratch sensoria under the cache; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.scratch.opens path/notes]] ~ name the path to ingest`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

